  "description": "Opt-in Verifiable Secret Sharing (Pedersen VSS) for PostQuantum.SecretSharing: detect a malicious dealer who issues inconsistent shares, with optional ML-DSA-65 signing of the commitment broadcast. Secrecy stays information-theoretic; dealer-fraud detection is computational (discrete-log) and documented as such. Unaudited new crypto, built to be cheap to audit.",
